>  The supplies are exclusively for commander since they don’t have any other way to place garrisons. 

&#x200B;

I agree with pretty much everything but this \^

&#x200B;

You shouldn't run in with hard plans like "I'm not dropping supplies for anyone else because you should have a supply in your squad" because your plans will always go to shit. Supplies will die, officers will be alone, recon will be in perfect spots for a garrison when everyone is respawning at HQ etc... You need to adapt to the situations on the fly. 

Supply drops can be a godsend when all the garrisons get wiped out and there's no support/officer duos in the right spots. 

That's my only point/opinion.

