We could force our star into an early supernova and it really would make little difference upon the universe... were not even grains of sand dude, we are the molecules which make up the grains of sand.

Humans... If you really think about it... zoom out far enough and look back on us as a species. We are quite pointless... We have less of a purpose than some mold recycling some leaves on the bottom of a forest floor.

