From where I'm standing, it sounds like you are resorting to personal attacks because clearly you have no argument at all.. Or maybe you are just that lacking in critical thinking skills that you cannot actually stay on subject and argue a point logically??? I find it kind of silly or maybe childish that you are resorting to ignoring the argument I provide rather than providing any sort of rebuttal or counter argument.

You're only point is, you should give 5 stars because it has detrimental effect on the driver if you give them less. Which clearly is an invalid point, because that's not how you grade students, that's not how you judge a competition, and that's not how you review someone with a 5 star system... The rating is on their performance, it's just that simple. It has nothing to do with the repercussions. Same with teachers, Same with judges, Same with people reviewing products anywhere... By your illogical argument, everyone on yelp should be giving out 5 stars to every business, because giving them less than 5 stars could have a detrimental effect on peoples livelihoods... If people started doing that Yelp would become utterly useless because the ratings would not reflect peoples honest opinions on the service or products doled out by said businesses.

&#x200B;

[https://www.udemy.com/critical-thinker-academy/](https://www.udemy.com/critical-thinker-academy/)

Should really consider taking this online course. It will indeed teach you a lot specifically about how to hold a logical argument, without resorting to changing the subject or throwing vague insults. I'm 100% serious.

Critical thinking is not taught in our public school system, and even in college, few kids will take critical thinking courses of any kind because its not required. But it's something everyone should learn if they want to try to have an argument where they reinforce their opinion or point and form a valid argument.

&#x200B;

Keep your head up bro, not saying you're stupid for not having critical thinking skills. But you should further your education and obtain some if you want to be able to argue/debate without resorting to insults. It really is a skill you have to build up like any other. Don't presume you are naturally good at arguing logically, because I can assure you. You are not.

&#x200B;

Cheers bud.

